# YOD4COINS – Tokenomics

## Purpose
YOD4COINS is the value and incentive layer of the offline-first settlement protocol. It is designed to reward reliable nodes, align long-term incentives, and support real economic activity in constrained environments.

## Maximum Supply
Fixed at genesis (recommended baseline: 1,000,000,000 YOD4COINS).  
No uncontrolled inflation.

## Genesis Allocation (Example)

| Category                      | Percentage | Vesting / Notes                          |
|------------------------------|------------|------------------------------------------|
| Founder / Architect Pool     | 12%        | 4-year linear vesting, 12-month cliff    |
| Core Contributors & Team     | 8%         | 3–4 year vesting                         |
| Ecosystem & Community        | 25%        | Gradual release via grants & bounties    |
| Node & Validator Rewards     | 40%        | Emitted over time based on participation |
| Treasury / Protocol Reserve  | 10%        | Multi-sig controlled                     |
| Liquidity & Launch           | 5%         | Available at genesis / early phases      |

## Protocol Utility Fee
- Fixed **0.1% (10 basis points)** on every settlement
- Calculated deterministically at the protocol level
- Automatically split (configurable) between:
  - Founder / Architect treasury
  - Host jurisdiction / sovereign treasury

## Node Rewards
Nodes that provide reliable local consensus and successful reconciliation are eligible for rewards drawn from the Node & Validator allocation.

## Principles
- Founder and team allocations are subject to multi-year vesting
- No large unlocked insider allocations at genesis
- All rules are designed to be transparent and auditable
